<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BAe a Merrill focus stock.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BAe a Merrill focus stock.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it named British Aerospace Plc one of the firm's Global Focus stocks.</p>
<p>-- Ratings on BAe remain near-term buy and long-term buy.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
